		<li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span><strong>Monthly Plan:</nobreak> If you need storage for a few months, this plan allows you the flexibility to rent our units for a minimum of one month. You can modify or cancel your reservation without incurring any penalties.</span></li>
		<li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span><strong>Annual Plan:</nobreak> For longer-term storage needs, our annual plan offers significant savings compared to monthly rentals. You can choose our units for a year and enjoy hassle-free storage without any lock-in commitments.</span></li>
	</ul>

	<p>At our storage facility, we believe in providing unprecedented flexibility to our customers. Unlike other providers, our rental terms offer zero lock-in penalties, allowing you to modify or cancel your reservation at any time without additional charges.</p>
	<p>In case you need to change your storage duration or unit size, simply give us a call or send us an email. Our team will promptly update your reservation details and ensure a seamless transition.</p>

	<p>To ensure transparency and peace of mind, we provide detailed itemized barcoded inventory receipts for all items stored in your unit. Each item is assigned a unique barcode, which allows you to easily track the items stored.</p>
	<p>In the event that you need to retrieve some items, these receipts serve as a comprehensive guide, enabling you to identify and access your belongings quickly.</p>

	<p>In addition to our flexible rental terms and comprehensive inventory systems, we offer hassle-free doorstep retrieval services.</p>
	<p>Whether you need to access your items urgently or simply prefer not to visit our facility, our doorstep retrieval service is designed to simplify the process.</p>
	<ul style="list-style: none; padding-left: 0; margin: 18px 0;">
		<li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span><strong>Convenient Doorstep Pickup:</strong> Our professional team will deliver a secure storage unit to your doorstep, allowing you to pack your items at your convenience.</span></li>
		<li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span><strong>Time-Saving Delivery:</strong> Once you've packed your items, we'll collect the storage unit and promptly deliver it to our secure facility.</span></li>
		<li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span><strong>Quick Retrieval:</strong> When you need to access your items, simply let us know, and we'll arrange for a doorstep delivery of your stored belongings.</span></li>
	</ul></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>



